{"id":"621880","name":"芹菜花生米","author":"卡老虎大厨","authorId":"10100702","desc":"","cover":"images/621880/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"花生米","amount":"500g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"芹菜","amount":"1把"}],"sub":[{"name":"调料包","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"芹菜胡萝卜改刀。","img":"images/621880/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"花生米凉水泡一下，泡的越久越好。","img":"images/621880/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入调料包，下水煮。","img":"images/621880/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"我用的这个锅。","img":"images/621880/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮15分钟然后下芹菜胡萝卜再煮两分钟。","img":"images/621880/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮完捞出晾凉。","img":"images/621880/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入盐，喜欢清淡的就加盐别的不用加，根据自己口味调料。","img":"images/621880/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入盘子放入冰箱。","img":"images/621880/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}